## figures/fig_rates.pdf — half width (`width=0.5\linewidth`)

**Supports:** P1 (C1). In the early window the measured slope of each direction's log-eigenvalue
follows the predicted net rate $2r_j(p_0)$, sign included. Input: experiment-repo
`results/raw/early_rate_scatter.csv` @ e8caa89 (slope fit corrected, experiment-repo#6), excluding
`stop_gradient_ablation` and `ode_vs_full` (5,376 directions × seeds). Printed values are computed by
the generator: $r=0.9997$, median $|$resid$|$ 0.0040, sign agreement 97.6% overall and 100% (asserted)
