> **Predicted versus measured early growth rates (P1).** Tier A linear JEPAs, 8 seeds per
> configuration, one point per direction and seed (5,376). $y$: least-squares slope of $\log\mu_j$ at
> steps 10, 50, 100, 200, 500. $x$: the prediction $2r_j(p_0)$ from the configuration's $s_j$, $c_j$,
> $p_0$, $\lambda$, with no fitted constant. Dashed: identity. Both axes are linear for
